        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions ELK150LAYSBR, Modern Brass Ruler Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Two Layered Brass Ruler Grip Pull features a middle pop-out that can be finished either the same or differently from the base for a huge selection of finish combinations ranging from super modern to sleek and transitional (modern traditional).  Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. This fantastic door handle can be mounted on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions ELK150LAYSBR 1/2 Inch Dual Layer Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ELK01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262335\"><b>First Impressions ELK150LAYSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>ELK150012LAYSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inset Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inset Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<b>ELK150024LAYSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inset Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inset Length: 22\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<b>ELK150036LAYSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inset Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inset Length: 34\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Two Layered Brass Ruler Grip Pull",
                "description": "The Two Layered Brass Ruler Grip Pull features a middle pop-out that can be finished either the same or differently from the base for a huge selection of finish combinations ranging from super modern to sleek and transitional (modern traditional).  Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. This fantastic door handle can be mounted on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors.\r\n",
                "keywords": "1/2 Inch Dual Layer Door Pulls, Two Layered Brass Ruler Grip Pulls, First Impressions ELK01, FII-ELK01, Modern Brass Ruler Pulls, Elk door pulls, First Impressions elk collection series 1 door pulls, modern door pulls, contemporary door pulls, two toned door pulls, door pulls with 2 different finishes, FII-ELK150LAYSBR, First Impressions ELK150LAYSBR,"
